        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Breathing and sleep are two of the most basic foundations of health, and they should come easily. If you live in the Inland Empire and deal with a chronic cough, shortness of breath, loud snoring, or nights of poor sleep, you know how much these problems can affect work, family, and everyday energy."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Getting answers often means seeing several providers in different places. We built the Inland Empire Lung & Sleep Institute (IE Lung) to bring pulmonary and sleep care together in one clinic."
          }
        ]
      },
